# Platform Surface Cohesion (PSC-001)

**Purpose:** Single enterprise contract for **cross-surface bootstrap, API egress, branding, and plugin resolution** across marketing · portal · admin — without breaking workspace isolation (L4 plugins mount via manifest codegen only).

**Principle:** Host resolves **tenantId** (WRS-001). **pluginId** comes from tenant registry / dev UUID map — never from hostname prefix heuristics in platform apps.

**Companion (execution):** [`temp/platform-surface-cohesion-roadmap.md`](../../temp/platform-surface-cohesion-roadmap.md) — phased convergence plan (temporary execution tracker).

---

## 1. Cohesion model

```text
┌─────────────┬──────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Concern     │ SoT package      │ Apps delegate (thin wrappers only)      │
├─────────────┼──────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Host parse  │ tenant-kernel    │ all surfaces                            │
│ Guest boot  │ guest-surface-host │ marketing + portal                  │
│ Admin boot  │ guest-surface-host + tenant-kernel │ web (converging)    │
│ API base URL│ guest-surface-host │ all BFF surfaces                    │
│ Branding    │ guest-surface-host │ all surfaces                        │
│ pluginId    │ API tenant-context + DEV_PLUGIN_ID map │ never hostname  │
│ Catalog path│ workspace-sdk    │ BFF uses resolveCatalog*ApiPath       │
│ Workspace UI│ manifest codegen │ never static-import workspace pkg     │
└─────────────┴──────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Workspace isolation invariant (unchanged):** Apps **must not** import `@app-tour/workspace-*` or `packages/workspaces/*`. Plugins load through `generate:workspace-registry` artifacts only (`import-boundary-ast`).

---

## 2. SoT matrix (normative)

| Decision | Marketing | Portal | Admin (web) | SoT |
| -------- | --------- | ------ | ----------- | --- |
| Bootstrap | `resolveMarketingBootstrapForHost` | `resolvePortalBootstrapForHost` | `resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHostAsync` | GSH `resolveGuestSurfaceBootstrapForHost` (M+P); web async uses `fetchPublicTenantContextForHost` |
| API base | `resolveTourOpsApiBaseUrl` from GSH | same | re-export GSH via `urban-api-base.ts` shim ✅ Phase 1a | `packages/guest-surface-host/src/resolve-tour-ops-api-base-url.ts` |
| Prod BFF fail-fast | `assertGuestBffProductionConfig` | same | `onBeforeFetch` in all branding paths (server + `/api/public/tenant-branding` BFF) ✅ Phase 1b | GSH |
| Branding fetch | delegate `fetchGuestPublicTenantBrandingForHost` | same | server helper + public BFF route delegate same helper ✅ Phase 1b | GSH `fetch-public-tenant-branding.ts` |
| pluginId (prod) | API `public/tenant-context` | same | API `public/tenant-context` | registry |
| pluginId (dev) | `resolveDevPluginIdForTenantId` | same | codegen map only ✅ Phase 1c | GSH `workspace-dev-plugin-ids.generated.ts` |
| Member session | none (PCMS) | `atour_mb_session` | `atour_op_session` | PCMS-001 |
| Catalog HTTP path | SDK `resolveCatalogListApiPath(pluginId)` | workspace-plugin-host | SDK paths ✅ Phase 1d | workspace-sdk |
| Operator capabilities | manifest `operatorCapabilities` → codegen | same | `fieldExposureSurfaces` etc. ✅ Phase 2 | workspace-sdk `WORKSPACE_OPERATOR_CAPABILITIES` |

---

## 3. Intentional divergences (do NOT converge)

| Divergence | Rationale | Standard |
| ---------- | --------- | -------- |
| Marketing anonymous | No member cookie probe | PCMS-001 |
| Portal fail-closed tenant bind | Security | PCMS-SEC-01 |
| Portal async JWT verify | Edge middleware | PCMS-SEC-02 |
| Admin BFF surface area larger | Operator features | platform-architecture-v2 |
| `workspace-plugin-host` portal-only | Registration flow composition | platform-portal-registration |
| Admin session bind fail-open for unmapped dev clubs | Operator velocity (review in Phase 4 — prod ingress-bound only) | PSC-C-05 |
| `starter` on guest surfaces | Admin-only scaffold — no `guestExtensionsVersion` | PSC-C-06 |

---

