## 5. Phased execution (normative order)

| Phase | Scope | Blocks |
| ----- | ----- | ------ |
| **0** | This doc + risk register + `guard-surface-cohesion` (warn mode) | — | ✅ |
| **1a** | Web API URL shim → GSH; tenant-context uses shared resolver | 0 | ✅ |
| **1b** | Web branding delegate; prod BFF assert | 1a | ✅ |
| **1c** | Remove hostname plugin heuristics; strict guard | 1a | ✅ |
| **1d** | Web catalog clients → SDK paths | 1a | ✅ |
| **2** | Manifest/codegen parity; extend certification guard | 1c | ✅ |
| **3** | Cross-surface smoke matrix (extend SMK-*) | 2 | ✅ |
| **4** | Closure — KPI met; platform-core extraction **deferred** (Architect charter) | 3 | ✅ doc |

**Phase 4 KPI (2026-07-12):** strict guard 0 baseline warnings · all P1 PSC-C-* closed · smoke matrix SMK-PSC-01..06 static green · guest-capable manifests have explicit `operatorCapabilities`. E2E hooks (SMK-WRS/MKT/PTL) run on demand with API+seed — not part of `phase-psc:fast-track`. **Deferred:** moving tenant bootstrap into `platform-core` — separate phase doc required (doc-first covenant).

**Rule:** No Phase 1 app code merge without Phase 0 doc + guard baseline on branch.

---

## 6. Guard modes (PSC-GUARD-01)

```bash
# Baseline — reports known debt, exit 0 (default)
pnpm run guard:surface-cohesion

# Fail-closed — Phase 1 admin debt cleared (1c+1d)
SURFACE_COHESION_GUARD_MODE=strict pnpm run guard:surface-cohesion
```

Guard checks:

1. M+P bootstrap delegates GSH
2. M+P branding delegates GSH
3. Web `urban-api-base.ts` re-exports GSH ✅ (Phase 1a closed)
4. Web tenant-context free of duplicate `apiBaseUrl()` ✅ (Phase 1a closed)
5. Web tenant-kernel free of hostname plugin heuristics ✅ (Phase 1c closed)
6. Web free of hardcoded workspace catalog paths ✅ (Phase 1d closed)
7. Web server branding delegates GSH ✅ (Phase 1b closed)
8. Web public BFF `/api/public/tenant-branding` delegates same server helper (no raw API fetch) ✅ (Phase 1b closure)
9. Web branding wires `assertGuestBffProductionConfig` via `onBeforeFetch` on all branding paths ✅ (Phase 1b closed)
10. Guest-capable manifests declare explicit `operatorCapabilities` — enforced by `guard:workspace-certification` (Phase 2, PSC-C-17; not duplicated in `guard:surface-cohesion`)
11. Cross-surface smoke matrix YAML + hook specs exist — `guard:surface-cohesion-smoke` (Phase 3; extends SMK-* — no duplicate Playwright suite)

---

## 7. Smoke matrix (Phase 3 — PSC-SMK-01)

**Authority:** [`docs/dev/platform-surface-cohesion-smoke-matrix.yaml`](../dev/platform-surface-cohesion-smoke-matrix.yaml)

| Tier | IDs | When to run |
| ---- | --- | ----------- |
| **Static (CI default)** | SMK-PSC-01..06 | `pnpm run test:surface-cohesion-smoke` + `pnpm run guard:surface-cohesion` |
| **E2E (manual / CI matrix)** | SMK-WRS-CUSTOM-APEX, SMK-MKT-03, SMK-PTL-01, SMK-PTL-08 | Existing commands in matrix YAML — **not** a new Playwright project |

```bash
# Fast static cross-surface closure
pnpm run test:surface-cohesion-smoke
pnpm run guard:surface-cohesion   # includes guard-surface-cohesion-smoke

# E2E (requires servers + seed — same as existing SMK-*)
pnpm run smoke:wrs-custom-apex
pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run test:smoke    # SMK-MKT-03
pnpm --filter @apps/portal run test:smoke       # SMK-PTL-01
pnpm --filter @apps/portal run test:smoke:custom-apex  # SMK-PTL-08
```

---

## 8. Verification

```bash
pnpm run guard:surface-cohesion
pnpm run test:surface-cohesion-smoke
pnpm run guard:wrs-routing
pnpm run guard:pcms-authority
pnpm run guard:import-boundary
pnpm run guard:guest-fetch-revalidate-parity
pnpm run guard:workspace-certification
pnpm run doc-gate
```

Phase 1+ adds `@apps/web` specs `guest-api-base-parity.spec.ts`, `urban-catalog-access.spec.ts` (WEB-PSC-1a-*, WEB-8.2-04). Phase 3 adds `scripts/test/surface-cohesion-cross-surface.spec.mjs` (SMK-PSC-03) and smoke matrix YAML.

**Fast-track (PSC closure — no full monorepo gate):**

```bash
pnpm run phase-psc:fast-track
```

**CI / fresh checkout:** build SDK before app tests when generated artifacts may be stale (`PSC-C-07`):

```bash
pnpm run build:workspace-sdk-for-guards
pnpm --filter @app-tour/guest-surface-host build   # when GSH TS sources changed
```

